### Health check (needs the server running: F5 -> "API: FastAPI (debug)")
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Interactive docs: open http://localhost:8000/docs in the browser

### Step 2: Triage, with coordinates in the message
POST http://localhost:8000/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sos_message": "URGENT SOS! Heavy flooding near Zoo Road Tiniali! Water is rising. 4 people injured on rooftop. Need 10 First Aid Kits and 2 Inflatable Rafts. Coordinates: 26.1750 N, 91.7750 E."
}

### Step 2: Triage, place name only (location is geocoded)
POST http://localhost:8000/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sos_message": "Help! Landslide blocked the road near Beltola Tiniali, 2 people hurt, we need 5 First Aid Kits and some drinking water."
}

### Step 3: Route without hazards (Zoo Road Tiniali -> Dispur, approximate coordinates)
POST http://localhost:8000/route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": {"lat": 26.1750, "lon": 91.7750},
  "destination": {"lat": 26.1433, "lon": 91.7898}
}

### Step 3: Same route with a hazard polygon (move the 4 corners onto the route you got above)
POST http://localhost:8000/route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": {"lat": 26.1750, "lon": 91.7750},
  "destination": {"lat": 26.1433, "lon": 91.7898},
  "hazards": [
    {
      "name": "Flooded stretch",
      "polygon": [
        {"lat": 26.1602, "lon": 91.7810},
        {"lat": 26.1602, "lon": 91.7820},
        {"lat": 26.1612, "lon": 91.7820},
        {"lat": 26.1612, "lon": 91.7810}
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### Step 2: The Khanapara SOS from the dashboard (must resolve to Khanapara, ~26.125 N 91.811 E, not the city centre)
POST http://localhost:8000/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sos_message": "We are stuck near the Khanapara bus stand. Flash floods have completely submerged the main road and water is rising fast. About 15 travelers are stranded on top of a bus stop roof. Please send inflatable rafts and drinking water immediately."
}

### Hazards: add a 400 m flood zone, list, delete (use the id from the add response)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/hazards
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Flooded underpass", "center": {"lat": 26.1500, "lon": 91.7850}, "radius_m": 400 }

###
GET http://localhost:8000/api/hazards

###
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/hazards/REPLACE_WITH_ID
